3. English translation: Marmaduke Pickthall (Tanzil en.pickthall)
==============================================================================

Work:     Mohammed Marmaduke William Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious
          Koran (first published 1930). The translator died in 1936.
Status:   Public domain (more than 70 years after the translator's death, and
          more than 95 years after first publication).
Source:   https://tanzil.net/trans/?transID=en.pickthall&type=txt-2
          (header "Last Update: September 4, 2010"), kept verbatim in
          data/tanzil/en.pickthall.txt.
Tanzil's terms for its translation files (https://tanzil.net/trans/, read
2026-10-22): the translations are provided "for non-commercial purposes only";
other uses need permission from the translator or publisher; projects using
more than three Tanzil translations must link back to https://tanzil.net/trans/.
This project uses two Tanzil files and links back anyway.

